  "provider_query": "用中文找 Rust 所有权机制的英文原文，要 The Rust Book 的 ownership 章节",
  "answer": "《The Rust Programming Language》（The Rust Book）所有权章节的英文原文在官方文档站点，当前版第 4 章为 **Understanding Ownership**。\n\n1. **章节导言 Understanding Ownership**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html  \n   来源：doc.rust-lang.org（现行 The Rust Book）\n\n2. **4.1 What Is Ownership?**（所有权规则、作用域、move、clone、Copy、Drop）  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-01-what-is-ownership.html  \n   来源：同上\n\n3. **4.2 References and Borrowing**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-02-references-and-borrowing.html  \n   来源：同上（本章相关小节）\n\n4. **4.3 The Slice Type**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-03-slices.html  \n   来源：同上\n\n5. **稳定版入口（stable）**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html  \n   来源：官方 stable 文档别名\n\n6. **全书目录（含第 4 章子节）**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/toc.html  \n   来源：官方目录页\n\n7. **全书首页**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/  \n   来源：Steve Klabnik、Carol Nichols、Chris Krycho 等；HTML 在线与 `rustup doc --book` 离线一致\n\n8. **旧版重定向说明（不要当现行原文）**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/book/ownership.html  \n   来源：旧链接页，指向新书对应章节；第一版另见 https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/first-edition/ownership.html\n\n核心三条规则的英文表述在 4.1：*Each value in Rust has an owner. There can only be one owner at a time. When the owner goes out of scope, the value will be dropped.*",
